+# Golden Quantum / ONE iGPU integration — v3.5.0
+
+## Scope and provenance
+
+This release evolves the attached v3.4 standalone package. It does **not** modify a GitHub repository, deploy a miner, or claim that all features of the canonical PYTHIPhiMiner repository have been ported. The original Golden Quantum source ZIP is not attached or embedded in the Notion package page. These are **new finite reference implementations derived from the page specifications**, not a byte-for-byte port or reproduction of its 121-test suite.
+
+The single owner remains `chronos`; numerical Golden Quantum components live under `chronos.golden_quantum`, orchestrated by `chronos.igpu.OneIGPU`. The repository's separate spelling/namespace `chronus` is an upstream port concern, not silently renamed here. Existing graphics, exact Lucas, academic, theory, native C/Rust, and algebra assets are retained.
+
+`SOURCE_MANIFEST.json` identifies all 15 loaded sources, their state, and their use. PR records describe another repository: they are not executable source or proof that this standalone ZIP contains those implementations. Closed/unmerged and draft PRs are tracked as proposals.
+
+## Page-to-code coverage
+
+Paths below are beneath `src/chronos/golden_quantum/`, unless stated otherwise.
