+| AdvancedMathematicalOracles | `oracles.py` | SHA256/SHA256d, uint32 nonce, little-endian exact target check |
+| MathematicalQuantumSearchEngine / GoldenQuantumComputer | `search.py` | Budgeted predicate search and actual small Grover state simulation; counts CPU oracle-mask evaluations |
+| GoldenTransform / DataFoldingEngine | `data_folding.py` | Reversible 1–3D phase transform and lossless zlib bytes, not canonical PULVINI |
