+| GoldenQuantumInfinityFold | `infinity_fold.py` | Bounded lane interleaving; no unexecuted huge search-space success |
+| CoherenceConstants / QuantumCoherenceAnalyzer | `coherence.py` | Norm/finiteness gate, no demonstrated nonce prediction |
+| GoldenRatioMining | `mining.py` | Offline bounded SHA256d scan with complete classical remainder |
